        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3-4. The Board agrees not to negotiate concerning said employees in the negotiating unit with any organization other than the Association for the duration of this Agreement. The Board and the Association also agreed that all negotiations be conducted in private and that strict confidentiality be maintained by both parties.",
